rison for six years for  bribery last year cuomo famously caused  the lonely deaths of thousands of  elderly new yorkers locked away in  nursing homes  so from day one andrew cuomo has been a  disaster for the state of new york and  yet  the democratic establishment has  relentlessly defended him why have they  done this  well because he helped them maintain  what they want most of all and that is  power  nothing has made elected democrats more  powerful than the kovid pandemic  they began as politicians lockdowns made  them  god andrew cuomo understood the power of  kovid  immediately as early as last april cuomo  declared that coronal law would last  forever  i don't think we get back to normal he  said i think we get to a  new normal now at the time there was no  vactine for the coronavirus so many  people reluctantly  accepted cuomo's prediction okay a new  normal but 11 months later we have  multiple coronavirus vaccines  infection rates are falling along with  deaths and yet the message from the  democratic establishment has not changed  your life is never going back to normal  we aren't surrendering our power over  you  or your children it's permanent now the  media rather than question this  amplified the message and they do it for  their own reasons when democratic  politicians become more powerful so do  their spokesman  in the news media stop expecting life to  go back to normal next year  read a new york times piece from  september a month later the paper ran a  story with this headline  the first coveted vaccine will not make  life normal again  now not everyone believed that of course  because it's ridiculous the whole point  of the vaccine was to bring life back to  normal  but the fact that people might live  normal lives deeply bothers the new york  times  go to their website today and you will  find this quote covet 19 the u.s is  edging toward normal  alarming some officials yes some  officials are alarmed you might be able  to go outside without 